  "instructions": [
    "heat the saffron-infused oil in a large paella pan over medium-high heat.",
    "add the calamari and cook until browned, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "add the garlic and onion and cook until the onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the kombu-cold-extract, red chili powder, thyme, and smoked paprika. stir to combine.",
    "add the chicken broth, water, rice, salt, and black pepper. bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low.",
    "simmer, uncovered, for 20-25 minutes or until the rice is cooked and the liquid has been absorbed.",
    "stir in the lemon juice and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes.",
    "remove from heat and let rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
